# What `docker build` never copies into an image (the build "context" is the repo root).
# Smaller context = faster builds, and secrets or local junk can't leak into an image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-*
.git
.github
.agents
.VSCodeCounter
.drafts
docs
supabase
**/*.md
# SECURITY: never bake secrets into an image. Config comes from the environment at runtime.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
